    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. I noticed you used terms like \"intuitive understanding\" for the first section and \"systematic science\" for the second. Can you expand a bit more on that distinction? I'm trying to understand if we should lean harder into the idea that the first group's approach was more about instinct and spiritual connection, whereas the second group was defined by actual logic and structured progress.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
